B.tl=new A.bA(B.Js,["Now","Next","Adhan","Iqamath","Subah","Sunrise","Luhar","Jum'ah","Asr","Magrib","Isha",B.fq,B.dZ,B.n5,"for Adhan","for Iqamath","passed Iqamath","Tarawih","Settings","Prayer Times","View prayer times for the entire month","No data available","Date","Dark Theme","Toggle between dark and light theme","Background Reliability","Disable to prevent missed alarms & notifications","Check","\u2705 Already exempted from battery optimization","Important",'If you miss prayer alarms or silent mode:\n1. Disable battery optimization above\n2. In phone Settings \u2192 Apps \u2192 Success Call \u2192 allow "Autostart" & "Background activity"\n3. For Xiaomi/MIUI: Security \u2192 Permissions \u2192 Autostart \u2192 Enable Success Call',"Zone","Masjidh","Select Masjidh","Notifications","Enable prayer time notifications","Notification Sound","Select notification sound","Default Sound","Adhan","Notification Settings","Notifications enabled","Notifications disabled","Enable/disable all prayer notifications","Configure notifications for each prayer individually","Notification enabled","Notification disabled","Sound","Sound Preview","Short beep sound","Adhan sound","Troubleshooting","Notifications not working?","\u2022 Allow app in battery optimization settings",'\u2022 Select "No restrictions" or "Unrestricted"',"\u2022 Ensure notification permissions are granted","Notification permission not granted. Permission is required for notifications to work.","Allow Notifications","Language","Select Language","Adhan","Iqamath","Iqamath in","Iqamath times are fixed for this mosque","Iqamath Times","Configure Masjidh Iqamath Times","Set the minutes between Adhan and Iqamath for each prayer of your nearest masjidh","minutes","Scheduling Notifications...","Please Wait","Select Zone","Select Your Zone","Choose your zone for accurate prayer times","Continue","About Us","Your Trusted Prayer Time Companion","About the App","Success Call is a comprehensive prayer time application designed to provide accurate prayer times for Muslims in Sri Lanka. With precise prayer times, iqamah timings, and notifications, it helps you stay on track with your daily prayers.","Features","Accurate prayer times for all zones in Sri Lanka","Customizable notifications for Adhan and Iqamah times","Zone selection based on your location","Multi-language support (Tamil, English, Sinhala)","Beautiful dark and light themes","Developer","Software Engineer","Contact","Support","For issues, suggestions, or feedback, please reach out via email. We value your feedback!","Credits","Special thanks to the Department of Muslim Religious Affairs, Sri Lanka, and all those who made the Success Call app possible.","New prayer times are based on ACJU data Updated from acju.lk","Updated from acju.lk","Old prayer times are sourced from mdisplay.github.io old data","Prayer Time Adjustment","Adjust Prayer Times","Fine-tune prayer times in minutes to match your location. Positive values delay the time, negative values advance it.","Adjustment range: -30 to +30 minutes","No adjustment","\u2705 Adjustments saved successfully","Current Adjustments","Reset All","Cancel","Save Changes","Back","Next","Finish","Select Your Language","Choose your preferred language for the app","Choose your prayer time zone","Data Source","New Prayer Times","Old Prayer Times","New Prayer Time Zones","Old Prayer Time Zones","Error completing setup","Silent Mode & Screen","Auto-silent for prayer, keep screen on","Auto Silent Mode","Enable Auto Silent","Automatically silence phone at Iqamah time","Silent Duration","Phone will be silenced from Adhan and will remain silent until after Iqamah","Screen Control","Keep Screen On","Prevent screen from turning off while app is open","Do Not Disturb Permission","Success Call needs permission to automatically silence your phone during prayer times.","Open Settings","Permission not granted. Please enable it and try again.","Permission granted! Silent mode enabled.","Battery Optimization","For silent mode to work reliably when the app is closed, please disable battery optimization for this app.","Skip","Disable Optimization","Reset","Save All Changes","Iqamah times saved successfully","zones","Select Month","Reset App","Clear all settings and restart","Reset App","This will clear all settings and return to onboarding. Continue?","Cancel","Reset","Per-Prayer Silent Mode","Enable/disable silent mode for each prayer individually","Silent mode enabled","Silent mode disabled","{manufacturer} device detected","Devices from this manufacturer aggressively kill background apps. To ensure notifications and silent mode work properly, follow the steps below.","Open App Settings","Steps for your device:"],t.yf)
